{
  "id": "bigville_action_life",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville R82 (block 404000): the CROP LIFECYCLE and RESIDENT METABOLISM. A crop is sown from its seed, then each period thirsts (cw_thirst); an actor must explicitly arm watering for cw_water to consume store water and grow one step, otherwise cw_wilt can kill it. Mature crops can be harvested by an actor. Residents get hungry each period (rh_hunger) and STARVE without food (rh_starve). Eating is an actor action in the world adapter: the old rule that consumed town stock directly is retained as an inert schema for compatibility but is not armed by any resident. All data-driven (CROPS + food-flagged items).",
